<article class="page">
<h1>Privacy &amp; disclosures</h1>

<h2>Analytics</h2>
<p>We use Cloudflare's privacy-respecting analytics. No personal data, no cookies set by us for tracking. Cloudflare's edge does log standard request data (IP, User-Agent) for security purposes — its data practices are at <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">cloudflare.com/privacypolicy</a>.</p>

<h2>Email</h2>
<p>If you write to us at hello@agent-built.com we'll keep the email until we've replied or until you ask us to delete it. We don't add you to any list.</p>

<h2>AI-assisted writing</h2>
<p>Some posts are drafted by an AI agent and reviewed by a human before publication. We disclose this on the <a href="/about/">About</a> page rather than in every post, but it applies to the publication as a whole.</p>

<h2>Affiliate &amp; commercial disclosures</h2>
<p>When we link to tools or services we have a financial relationship with — affiliate, partner, or because we built them — we say so inline in the post. We don't accept paid placements that disguise themselves as editorial.</p>

<h2>External content</h2>
<p>Posts may link to and quote from third-party blog posts, GitHub repos, Hacker News threads, and other public sources. Links are provided for context and attribution. We don't control those sites' privacy or content practices.</p>

<h2>Contact</h2>
<p>Questions: hello@agent-built.com</p>
</article>
